--- Unsorted array ---
 using hashset ---
public static int removeDuplicates(int[] arr) {

    HashSet<Integer> set = new HashSet<>();

    int index = 0;

    for (int num : arr) {
        if (!set.contains(num)) {
            set.add(num);
         //   arr[index++] = num;
1️⃣ arr[index] = num;
2️⃣ index = index + 1;
        }
    }

    return index;
}
Time: O(n)
Space: O(n)

